  m_text: "A virus has entered a game. It has camouflaged itself to a helmet model
    in the armoury. \n\nYou must find the virus and destroy it. A virus can replicate
    the texture of an object, but not able to fully replicate the wireframe.\n\nUse
    the scan view to help you. The scan view will show you a model's wireframe and
    its collider.\n\nDo not destroy any other object other than the virus. It will
    break the game permanently.\n\nYou will start in the basement of the main castle.
    Go up to the first floor, cross the bridge, and enter the second castle to find
    your way to the armoury.\n\nWASD to move, Space to jump"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
